-Omong kosong.

459
00:20:49.271 --> 00:20:50.971
Itu terlalu sulit. Datang lagi?

460
00:20:51.038 --> 00:20:52.171
Berikut ini contohnya.

461
00:20:52.238 --> 00:20:53.971
Sepak bola, Park Ji-sung.

462
00:20:54.038 --> 00:20:55.938
Oke, kita punya satu. Park Ji Sung.

463
00:20:56.005 --> 00:20:57.371
