475
00:21:17.205 --> 00:21:21.705
bulutangkis, Lee Yong-dae,
tenis, Lee Hyung-taik,

476
00:21:21.771 --> 00:21:23.005
berenang, Park Tae-hwan.

477
00:21:23.071 --> 00:21:24.738
Kami membutuhkan dua lagi. Kita hampir selesai.

478
00:21:25.305 --> 00:21:26.638
-Dia tidak ingat.
-Aku sudah bilang semuanya.

479
00:21:26.705 --> 00:21:29.105
Sepak Bola, Park Ji-sung,
bisbol, Lee Dae-ho,

480
00:21:29.871 --> 00:21:31.871
bulutangkis, Lee Yong-dae,

481
