487
00:21:43.038 --> 00:21:44.338
-Tenis meja.
-Ya.

488
00:21:46.105 --> 00:21:47.171
Siapa?

489
00:21:47.671 --> 00:21:48.871
Apakah kamu gila?

490
00:21:48.938 --> 00:21:49.771
Tenis meja?

491
00:21:49.838 --> 00:21:51.071
-Apa yang sedang kamu lakukan?
-Apa?

492
00:21:51.138 --> 00:21:52.205
Nam-kyu.

493
00:21:52.771 --> 00:21:54.005
-Lima…
-Jeong Nam-kyu?

494
00:21:54.071 --> 00:21:55.605
